  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 402.29 Listed release detection equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.29 “Listed release detection equipment” means release detection equipment that has been evaluated in accordance with a nationally-approved protocol by an independent testing laboratory and demonstrated to meet the specified evaluation criteria at the specified probability of detection and probability of false alarm.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 402.22) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
